        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Pat Callanan Property Sales are delighted to bring this charming detached bungalow at Gortbeg, Cummer, Tuam, Co. Galway, H54 A622, to the open market for sale by private treaty.\n\nSet on an attractive 0.3-acre site, this traditional-style cottage offers a peaceful rural setting while remaining within easy commuting distance of a range of local amenities. The property is located approximately 9.7km from Tuam, 20km from Athenry, and less than an hour?s drive from Galway City.\n\nThe property is approached via a gravel driveway providing ample off-street parking, with well-maintained grass lawns to both the front and rear.\n\nInternally, the accommodation comprises a welcoming living room featuring a solid fuel stove set within a characterful timber-surround fireplace, along with useful storage space. The adjoining dining kitchen is fitted with a range of kitchen units and provides a practical space for everyday living and dining.\n\nThere are two generous bedrooms, both benefiting from timber-effect laminate flooring, together with a main bathroom.\n\nThe property is serviced by mains water and a septic tank, with heating provided by oil-fired central heating supplemented by the solid fuel stove. The property would be eligible for application to SEAI grant schemes to enhance the BER.\n\nThis charming bungalow represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a traditional rural home in a peaceful location, while still being within a convenient commute of Tuam, Athenry and Galway City.\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Pat Callanan Property Sales Ltd. on 091 844 818 or by email.\n\nServices \nmains water"
      },
